meta {
  name: Get Inventory Tree Map
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/stats/inventory/tree_map
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Inventory Tree Map

  This request is used to get inventory mapping in tree map format. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and have a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Stats fetched successfully**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "stats fetched",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "room_ddd072238abb3528f043222882b92c03",
        "name": "Main Room",
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "storage_d399fd2dbae5d34c249a34287dfcb9bb",
            "name": "Wardrobe",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "rack_f8129906877dbc7b50bf30bc79a2129d",
                "name": "Shoes & Sandals - Bottom",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "id": "item_387722ed612ed175f47cc906e0e1fdf9",
                    "name": "New Balance2112"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — stats failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "stats not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}